  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing People-Centred Justice and Security Systems in Asia and the Pacific (2026&#x2013;2028) is a regional initiative led by UNDP&#x2019;s Bangkok Regional Hub to strengthen inclusive, accountable, and resilient justice systems across the Asia-Pacific region. Responding to stagnating rule of law indicators, widening justice gaps, and emerging challenges from digital transformation, climate impacts, and political fragility, the project focuses on improving access to justice for marginalized groups and rest</narrative>
  </description>
